<section id="process"><div class="wrap">
<div class="grid sh"><span class="lbl">Process</span><h2>Five steps, in order.</h2></div>
<div class="st rv"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Research</h3><p>Audit the brand, the audience and the competitors before anything is made.</p></div>
<div class="st rv"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Strategy</h3><p>Set goals, pick channels and define the message and the measures of success.</p></div>
<div class="st rv"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Creation</h3><p>Write, shoot and design content that fits each platform.</p></div>
<div class="st rv"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Execution</h3><p>Schedule, publish and engage with the community daily.</p></div>
<div class="st rv"><span class="n">05</span><h3>Analysis</h3><p>Read the results, report plainly and feed what worked into the next cycle.</p></div>
</div></section>

